Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:02.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅德尼亞的實驗室
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:07.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還不巧地被ZAFT…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:08.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐說的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是…難以置信！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:18.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘴上說協調者是違背自然的錯誤存在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:20.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己卻幹這種事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:24.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,操縱遺傳因子是錯誤的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.67,0:00:27.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就不是嗎？就可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:29.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:31.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼能冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.53,0:00:33.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親還在實驗室裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:37.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傻瓜 奧盧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:43.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親 母親
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:46.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會死的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:48.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:55.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 MS1接近中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是Gaia
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護設施
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:00:59.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白嗎 阿斯蘭 真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:00.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:02.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,母親 保護
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.09,0:01:09.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,注意 真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:11.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果目的是破壞設施
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.59,0:01:13.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能攜帶了什麼特殊裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:20.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別把它破壞掉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:35.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,女的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.59,0:01:39.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是她？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:43.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Phase-26  約定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉  為什麼妳會…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:43.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能…死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:53.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕…保護…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:12.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:14.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真  幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:19.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:20.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:23.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.24,0:04:28.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎是帶著負傷的敵方駕駛員 朝Minerva去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:30.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:32.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會  自作主張想幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:34.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse回航?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:36.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事  突然這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:37.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.23,0:04:42.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼了 真…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:43.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦  讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.91,0:04:46.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先回艦去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:48.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓雷去回收Gaia
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:50.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:53.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能…死…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:56.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:57.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:00.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:04.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:08.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會…我會好好保護妳的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.67,0:05:10.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:15.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,醫生  快救救這女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:18.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.55,0:05:22.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那軍服…不是聯合的士兵嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:24.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但她受傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:25.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:28.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕…保護…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:32.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 要治療敵軍必須要有艦長的批准
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒接到任何指示
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:37.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種東西我會馬上弄來  所以快點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:39.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會死嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要是死了要怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:44.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會死…不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:04.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:08.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:10.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:13.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:14.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:18.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒事了  冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:22.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:31.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰批准你把敵兵搬送至艦內的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.65,0:06:37.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的所為違反了軍法第4條第2項
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:39.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並與第11條第6項相抵觸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.61,0:06:43.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是無可辯駁的重大軍紀違反
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.61,0:06:47.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果因此使艦內蒙受巨大損失
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:48.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:51.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:55.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說你認識那女孩  是叫史黛拉?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:06:58.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是在何時何地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:01.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奧基亞的海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:03.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她差點溺水  我救了她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:10.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.35,0:07:15.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要死…好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:18.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以叫你等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.48,0:07:21.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別過去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:25.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會死嗎…會死人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:31.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這女孩…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:34.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不清楚她究竟是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.65,0:07:39.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我那時以為她也是戰爭的受害者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:43.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但她是Gaia的駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為她坐在上面  明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:52.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而說不定…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:55.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:58.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長  能來一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:00.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.97,0:08:03.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是女的? 那個聯合的駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.07,0:08:06.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我可被整得好慘  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:09.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但為什麼真會那麼做…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:33.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這樣對她  她受傷了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:35.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才她是太激動了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:37.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:43.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來這女孩…是聯合的強化人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:46.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:48.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在吃了藥睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:52.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但說實話也不知道藥效會持續多久
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:56.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,治療之前進行了簡單的檢查
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:59.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得到的都是令人驚訝的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:04.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首先是體內各種物質的數值十分異常
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:10.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也檢測出多種原本人體不可能含有的物質
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:14.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人工操作…是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:15.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用藥物?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:23.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,詳細情況要到更專門的機構檢查才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:28.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大概看一下與那研究所的數據非常相似
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:34.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然戰鬥中所受外傷也不輕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.74,0:09:36.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之這種情況下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:40.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算要繼續治療  也不太清楚該怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:42.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:55.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:09:59.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,退開
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:05.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:20.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:23.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事了  史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.51,0:10:24.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:26.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有我在  冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:28.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,認得嗎  是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.97,0:10:29.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是真啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.24,0:10:48.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不認識…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:51.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不認識你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:55.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐…尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:56.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.17,0:10:59.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她的腦波模式很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.17,0:11:06.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能連意識和記憶也被操作過
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:08.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒用的  停止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:22.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要…這裡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,記憶…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:26.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:29.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會…有這種事…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先不說羅德尼亞的實驗室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,關於史黛拉 露西的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:45.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也已經被認定為損失
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:50.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我太大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:53.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  上校已經很好地發揮了他們的作用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.84,0:11:55.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾先生也有所耳聞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:57.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別再說這些了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:00.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,損失…嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:11.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,軍隊裡是用這個詞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:15.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:20.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  消去他們倆對史黛拉的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.96,0:12:21.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要消去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.87,0:12:26.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這需要費一番功夫了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:28.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.99,0:12:32.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了  馬上開始
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.80,0:12:36.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好  Minerva出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:38.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,離地  上升
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向塔魯基烏斯港前進
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:02.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:31.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:36.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,居然什麼都不記得…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:44.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然會去駕駛Gaia…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:51.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還在那種地方待過…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.20,0:13:57.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:04.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:08.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來找我了  真
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:14.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.04,0:14:16.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:20.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,認得我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:25.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:52.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:54.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.69,0:14:56.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:03.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.95,0:15:06.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球真是不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:08.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在想阿斯蘭的事?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:14.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:17.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:19.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也能理解他說的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:22.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以還不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:24.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:29.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT如果真像阿斯蘭說得那樣  我們…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.46,0:15:34.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布雖然也有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.49,0:15:37.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們怎麼做才是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.61,0:15:40.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:46.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我要去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:49.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:54.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尋找道路也需要線索
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.83,0:15:57.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以  你在PLANT會…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:59.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:13.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:20.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是應該去的時候了  讓我去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:22.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好嗎 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:29.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上月開始在ZAFT各駐軍舉行的拉克絲勞軍演出
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:33.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明天終於要落幕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.48,0:16:40.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她在上次大戰中也曾與父親希格爾 克萊茵 一起呼籲停止戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:43.78,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(638,628)}{\fad(500,500)}黑海沿岸都市 迪奧基亞 ZAFT軍基地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:47.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在也和狄蘭達爾議長同為早日結束戰爭而造訪各地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:50.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她回響在ZAFT卡利斯馬基地的歌聲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:55.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對在艱苦環境下英勇奮戰的將士來說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:58.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,實在是心靈中的一片綠洲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:02.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:04.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,行李就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:06.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:08.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:16.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐一路辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:18.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:22.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開門見山地說 已經沒有時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:24.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能馬上準備穿梭機嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:25.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.17,0:17:29.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過來得比預定時間要早
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:31.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在趕時間  所以來早了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:33.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你們也能配合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:35.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是  馬上處理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:41.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐搭乘的穿梭機計劃提前
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.96,0:17:43.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,準備完成後便出發
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:46.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各機組人員優先支援  重複
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:48.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  太榮幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:49.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.51,0:18:03.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼一個迎接的人都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:08.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  這麼冷落人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:11.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:14.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穿梭機的出發準備已經完成
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:19.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼都沒人來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:22.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.23,0:18:24.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:37.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:43.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以  那是真貨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:47.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不對不對  是假貨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:50.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是冒名頂替的假貨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:52.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,停下穿梭機 停止起飛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:56.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  晚了一步
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:19:00.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 真的要起飛了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.61,0:19:01.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:03.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出動MS  不能讓穿梭機起飛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:11.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啟動  是緊急起飛令
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:14.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雅賓隊 BABI出動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.89,0:19:16.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,達耶魯隊  出動路線清空
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿里斯提亞隊  進入防空準備
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:20.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,馬格林隊  出動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.42,0:19:45.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  上去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:01.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:14.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:17.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:36.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.67,0:20:45.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:46.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:47.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:52.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都被歌姬大膽的想法嚇到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:55.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這樣總算OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:57.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是擔心  拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:01.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不可以 基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:04.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel如果沒你在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:08.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長和卡嘉莉該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:09.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:11.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.28,0:21:17.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會回到你身邊  所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:24.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走到這步就別任性了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.50,0:21:26.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會保護好她的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:29.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,代替你  拼了命也會
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:30.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,巴爾特菲路特先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.87,0:21:32.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放心交給我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.01,0:21:33.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:37.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:40.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要當心  拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:41.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:43.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.36,0:23:26.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不得不戰鬥 這是為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.29,0:23:30.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不戰鬥就無法保護 保護什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:33.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不同的想法都是正義
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.79,0:23:38.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對峙的槍口前各自的夢想是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.49,0:23:43.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集  機動戰士鋼彈 SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.17,0:23:45.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未傳達的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.10,0:23:49.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,衝破驚濤駭浪吧  Archangel
